{"applicability_conditions":"适用于3.5 wt% NaCl溶液浸泡试验的失重法腐蚀速率计算；试验中试样尺寸为30 × 25 × 3 mm，溶液每7天更换一次，浸泡周期为30天。","identity":{"block_id":"b0026","equation_id":"equation_001","equation_number":"1","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\nu = \\frac {\\left(W _ {0} - W _ {\\mathrm{t}}\\right) \\times 8 . 7 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {4}}{\\rho S t}\\tag{1}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.corsci.2025.113331"},"latex":"\\nu = \\frac{(W_{0} - W_{\\mathrm{t}}) \\times 8.76 \\times 10^{4}}{\\rho S t}","purpose":"通过浸泡试验中的失重计算低密度钢（LDSs）的腐蚀速率。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"corrosion rate（腐蚀速率）","symbol":"\\nu","unit":"mm/y","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"initial weight of the sample（试样初始重量）","symbol":"W_{0}","unit":"g","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"weight of the sample after rust removal（除锈后试样重量）","symbol":"W_{\\mathrm{t}}","unit":"g","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"immersion area（浸泡面积）","symbol":"S","unit":"cm^2","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"immersion time（浸泡时间）","symbol":"t","unit":"d","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"density of the LDSs（低密度钢的密度）","symbol":"\\rho","unit":"g/cm^3","value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":null,"symbol":"8.76 \\times 10^{4}","unit":null,"value":"8.76 × 10^{4}"}],"unmapped":["系数 8.76 × 10^{4} 为数值换算常数，论文未明确解释其来源或构成。"]}